"Mānasa Deho Geho"],"author":["by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["mānasa, deho, geho, jo kichū mora","arpilu̐ tuyā pade, nanda-kiśora!"],"translation":["Mind, body, and family, whatever may be mine, I have surrendered at Your lotus feet, O youthful son of Nanda!"],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["sampade vipade, jīvane-maraṇe","dāy mama gelā, tuyā o-pada varaṇe"],"translation":["In good fortune or in bad, in life or at death, all my difficulties have disappeared by choosing those feet of Yours as my only shelter."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["mārobi rākhobi—jo ichā tohārā","nitya-dāsa prati tuyā adhikārā"],"translation":["Slay me or protect me as You wish, for You are the master of Your eternal servant."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["janmāobi moye ichā jadi tora","bhakta-gṛhe jani janma hau mora"],"translation":["If it is Your will that I be born again, then may it be in the home of Your devotee."],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["kīṭa-janma hau yathā tuyā dāsa","bahir-mukha brahma-janme nāhi āśa"],"translation":["May I be born again even as a worm, as long as I may remain Your devotee. I have no desire to be born as a Brahmā averse to You."],"isLong":false},{"number":"6","text":["bhukti-mukti-spṛhā bihīna je bhakta","labhaite tā̐ka saṅga anurakta"],"translation":["I yearn for the company of the devotee completely devoid of all desire for worldly enjoyment or liberation."],"isLong":false},{"number":"7","text":["janaka, jananī, doyita, tanoy","prabhu, guru, pati—tuhu̐ sarva-moy"],"translation":["Father, mother, lover, son, Lord, preceptor, and husband — You are everything to me."],"isLong":false},{"number":"8","text":["bhakativinoda kohe, śuno kāna!","rādhā-nātha! tuhu̐ hāmāra parāṇa"],"translation":["Bhakti Vinod says, “O Krishna, please hear me! Oh Lord of Rādhā, You are my life and soul!”"],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/govinda-maharaj-manasa-deho","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Kamal Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/jayasri-sound/11-manasa-deha-geha","personSlug":"kamal-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/manasa-deho-geho","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":null},"head":{"canonical":"/en-2022/manasa-deho-geho-jo-kichu-mora/","description":"Mānasa Deho Geho — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Kirtan Guide.","title":"Mānasa Deho Geho. by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en-2022","slug":"manasa-deho-geho-jo-kichu-mora"}}